      "text": {
        "jp": "しょうがないわね。\r\nその強さに免じておまけしてあげる。",
        "official_en": "<text style=\"italic\">Fiiine</>, I guess you’ve earned a discount.",
        "real_en": "<text style=\"italic\">Fiiine</>. Seeing how strong you are, I'll waive the extra fee."
