      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そのためにあんたたちを\r\nボディガードにしてるんじゃない！",
        "official_en": "Well, what use is a bodyguard if they can’t even fend off monsters such as these?",
        "real_en": "That's why I've got you as my bodyguards!"
      },
