      "text": {
        "jp": "ただし、アタシが大怪我でも負ったら\r\nその時は……わかってるでしょうね？",
        "official_en": "But, if I get hurt real bad... You know I’m coming for your wallets, right?",
        "real_en": "But if I get seriously hurt, then... you know what happens, right?"
