      "text": {
        "jp": "ふーん？\r\nその船、壊れないように頼むわよ。",
        "official_en": "Really? Well then, I hope you guys are used to hiking on your tippy toes.",
        "real_en": "Oh yeah? Then you'd better make sure that ship doesn't sink!"
